This context manager has a resource leak. Fix it:
```python
class DBConnection:
    def __init__(self, dsn: str):
        self.conn = psycopg2.connect(dsn)
    def __enter__(self):
        return self.conn.cursor()
    def __exit__(self, *args):
        self.conn.commit()
```

